  "description": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Initial Request**: Modified `ChatGlobalPrompts.vue` to replace the textarea with the `CodeViewer` component for enhanced prompt editing capabilities.\n\n2. **V-model Integration**: Added v-model support to `CodeViewer` by introducing a `promptContent` data property that syncs with the component's internal state.\n\n3. **Auto-save Behavior**: When `CodeViewer` uses v-model mode, the \"Save\" button is automatically hidden and changes are emitted in real-time to update parent settings.\n\n4. **State Management**: Implemented a watcher to sync external `settings.chat_global_instructions` with the local `promptContent`, ensuring bidirectional data binding.\n\n5. **Final Implementation**: The updated component provides a rich code editor experience for global chat prompts with real-time preview, character counter, and automatic synchronization without manual save actions.",
